{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】黃大仙有貨車撞向防撞欄後翻側，司機受傷送院。</p>\n<p>翻側的貨車橫臥路中，車頭嚴重損毀，輪胎飛脫。凌晨4時許，涉事貨車沿太子道東往觀塘方向行駛，駛至近觀塘繞道時撞向路中間的防撞欄後翻側，司機自行離開車廂，清醒送伊利沙伯醫院治理。警員封閉一段路面，調查意外原因。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T23:20:18.709006+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T23:37:37.705674+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T23:18:09.197581+00:00","content_hash":"4623707a592937fae816ba476033252e4d7a69a3cc35d8f8ac0500dd4cfa9436","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}